## Real triple count in graph status; drop stale zero-total Overview cache
================================================================================

Context:
Follow-up before deploy. The graph status probe reported a placeholder
count of 1 (``LIMIT 1``), and Overview payloads cached by the previous
build (entity types present, ``total_triples`` 0) would keep being served.

Changes:

1. src/back/core/graphdb/delta/DeltaOverviewStats.py
   ``triple_count``: ``COUNT(*)`` on ``…_props``.
2. src/back/core/graphdb/delta/DeltaFlatStore.py
   Graph ``get_status`` uses ``triple_count``; ``LIMIT 1`` on
   ``…_entity_search`` only when ``…_props`` is missing.
